/* ============================================================
   telltale-art.js — drawn SVG pictures for the twelve core words
   on the Tell-Tale Heart pages. Same 200x160 card as landlady-art.js.
   Abstract words are contrast pairs (the right side carries the red X);
   concrete words are one detailed scene. No caption names the word.

   Use:  LL_ART["vulture"]            -> svg string
         llArt("vulture", "class")    -> svg string with a class added
   If a page has #words-tab .wcard[data-w] cards, the file swaps
   each card's emoji (.we) for its picture on load.
   ============================================================ */

